OL,3,GNEWSAWoman died after one-year delay in
OL,4,Acancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust has been told it must take
OL,7,Faction after a woman's cancer diagnosis
OL,8,Fwas delayed for about one year before
OL,9,Fshe died.
OL,11,FGloria Monte, 79, died of lung cancer
OL,12,Fat Nottingham City Hospital on 2 May
OL,13,F2025.
OL,15,FAn inquest at Nottingham Coroner's
OL,16,FCourt, which concluded in August, heard
OL,17,Fa nodule was discovered on her lung in
OL,18,FFebruary 2024, and although she was
OL,19,Ftold it "could be" a primary lung
OL,20,Ftumour, it was never investigated. She
OL,21,Fwas diagnosed with cancer the following
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
