OL,3,GNEWSAWoman died after one-year delay in
OL,4,Acancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquest found there had been a
OL,7,Fdelay in her diagnosis "due to
OL,8,Findividual and systemic omissions in
OL,9,Fher medical care" by Nottingham
OL,10,FUniversity Hospitals (NUH) NHS Trust,
OL,11,Fwhich has apologised to Monte's family.
